{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_migration", "label": "MIGRATION.md \u2014 Phase 1 prototype migration", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/MIGRATION.md", "source_location": "L1", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_migration_phase_1_migration", "label": "Phase 1: single-file prototype \u2192 bundled Vite + React + TypeScript", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/MIGRATION.md", "source_location": "L1-L7", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Turn the prototype into a bundled project with no runtime CDN dependency, without changing what the app does."}, {"id": "docs_migration_v24_prototype", "label": "v24 single-file prototype (27 script parts, one global scope)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/MIGRATION.md", "source_location": "L3-L7", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "One HTML page assembled by Python scripts; React, lucide, pdf.js, mammoth, Tesseract and fonts came from CDNs at runtime; a reference copy is kept in prototype/."}, {"id": "docs_migration_module_split", "label": "Automated module split (TypeScript compiler API: analyze.cjs \u2192 generate.cjs)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/MIGRATION.md", "source_location": "L9-L15", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "888 top-level names and 40 forward references, none evaluated at load time; each declaration went to its part's module (a few moves break cycles) and the module graph was checked for cycles (none)."}, {"id": "docs_migration_module_part_map", "label": "Module \u2194 prototype part map", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/MIGRATION.md", "source_location": "L17-L54", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_migration_hand_written_modules", "label": "Modules written by hand in Phase 1 (main, App, TopBar, ScreenLoading, vendor, ocr, i18n)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/MIGRATION.md", "source_location": "L56-L58", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "vendor.ts and ocr.ts bundle the libraries in place of CDN loaders; i18n.ts imports the dictionary as JSON."}, {"id": "docs_migration_left_in_prototype", "label": "Prototype-only code left behind (brand board, device previews, live code editor)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/MIGRATION.md", "source_location": "L60-L65", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "These existed only to present the prototype and are not part of the product; about 170 dictionary strings went with them."}, {"id": "docs_migration_gradual_types", "label": "Gradual typing (gradual-types.cjs + type-fixes.cjs, strict off)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/MIGRATION.md", "source_location": "L67-L75", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Explicit gradual types let tsc check every file without rewriting logic (0 errors with strict off); follow-up: strictNullChecks, then strict, module by module from domain/ and lib/."}, {"id": "docs_migration_cdn_to_bundle", "label": "Runtime dependencies moved from CDNs into the bundle", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/MIGRATION.md", "source_location": "L77-L91", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "React, Tailwind, lucide, fonts, pdf.js, mammoth and Tesseract now ship with the app, so the built app makes no request outside its own origin."}, {"id": "docs_migration_code_splitting", "label": "Code splitting (admin console + CV review lazy chunks; pdf.js / mammoth / Tesseract on demand)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/MIGRATION.md", "source_location": "L93-L96", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The member app loads first; the heavy readers load only when a file is read."}, {"id": "docs_migration_test_port", "label": "Prototype test suites ported to Vitest (stub React harness)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/MIGRATION.md", "source_location": "L98-L110", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "13 suites ported unchanged in intent: the harness imports every module into one lookup object C (the old shared scope) and vitest aliases react / lucide-react to stubs for tests only."}, {"id": "docs_migration_i18n_port", "label": "i18n extract / build scripts ported to Node", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/MIGRATION.md", "source_location": "L112-L116", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The rebuilt dictionary matches the prototype's exactly \u2014 no entry added or changed, same order."}, {"id": "docs_migration_pdfjs_cve_2024_4367", "label": "pdf.js CVE-2024-4367 fix (getDocument with isEvalSupported: false)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/MIGRATION.md", "source_location": "L120-L122", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "pdf.js 3.11 can run script from a crafted PDF's font program; both getDocument calls (CV import, verification preview) disable eval; npm audit still lists pdfjs-dist by version."}, {"id": "docs_migration_mammoth_upgrade", "label": "mammoth 1.8 \u2192 1.13 upgrade (GHSA-rmjr-87wv-gf87)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/MIGRATION.md", "source_location": "L123", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Fixes external file access from a crafted .docx."}, {"id": "docs_migration_tar_override", "label": "tar dependency override (patched version)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/MIGRATION.md", "source_location": "L124-L125", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Only reached through pdf.js's optional Node canvas dependency and never part of the app."}, {"id": "docs_migration_dead_controls_fix", "label": "Dead logo controls removed after the brand board", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/MIGRATION.md", "source_location": "L126-L128", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The crawl found the member header's logo button and the top bar's logo with nothing left to do; both are plain marks now and the top-bar logo links only from the admin console."}, {"id": "docs_migration_tailwind_cwd_fix", "label": "Tailwind independent of the working directory (content.relative)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/MIGRATION.md", "source_location": "L130-L133", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Tailwind 3 resolved its globs from the cwd, so a dev server started elsewhere produced almost no classes; now the CSS is byte-for-byte the same wherever the build starts."}, {"id": "docs_migration_in_browser_crawl", "label": "In-browser click-everything crawl (tools/crawl-ui.js, window.__engspaceDev)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/MIGRATION.md", "source_location": "L135-L140", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Exercises every visible control from every start state and records console errors, controls that change nothing and controls without a handler; the dev build's window.__engspaceDev (compiled out of production) lets it restart the app on each deep link."}, {"id": "docs_migration_follow_ups", "label": "Phase 1 follow-ups (strict TypeScript, pdf.js 4/5, lazy English dictionary, admin web app)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/MIGRATION.md", "source_location": "L142-L149", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": nu